<title>USA: GOLF-SECOND ROUND LEADERS AT BAY HILL INVITATIONAL.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SECOND ROUND LEADERS AT BAY HILL INVITATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Florida 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round leaders</p>
<p>at the $1.5 million Bay Hill Invitational golf tournament on</p>
<p>Friday. Play was halted by darkness with 20 golfers yet to</p>
<p>finish their rounds (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>135 Skip Kendall 70 65</p>
<p>136 Stuart Appleby (Australia) 73 63, Omar Uresti 69 67</p>
<p>137 Phil Mickelson 72 65, Paul Stankowski 67 70, Loren</p>
<p>Roberts 70 67</p>
<p>138 Don Pooley 73 65, Brian Henninger 70 68, Mark O'Meara 72</p>
<p>66, Nick Price (Zimbabwe) 70 68</p>
<p>139 Jay Don Blake 69 70, Doug Martin 71 68, Steve Pate 69 70,</p>
<p>Greg Kraft 70 69, Payne Stewart 69 70, Tiger Woods 68 71,</p>
<p>Larry Mize 71 68, Bernhard Langer (Germany) 69 70, Len</p>
<p>Mattiace 70 69</p>
<p>Add non-U.S. scores of completed rounds:</p>
<p>141 Vijay Singh (Fiji) 69 72, Nick Faldo (Britain) 71 70</p>
<p>143 Ian Woosnam (Britain) 70 73, Wayne Grady (Australia) 72</p>
<p>71, Naomichi &quot;Joe&quot; Ozaki (Japan) 70 73</p>
<p>144 Grant Waite (New Zealand) 71 73</p>
<p>146 David Frost (South Africa) 73 73, Yoshinori Kaneko</p>
<p>(Japan) 70 76</p>
<p>147 Steve Elkington (Australia) 74 73</p>
</text>
